---
import '@/styles/global.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head
    ><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta
      name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width"
    /><title>Configuration Required · P_CEO_OS</title></head
  >
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-app-sidebar text-app-foreground">
    <main class="grid min-h-screen place-items-center px-5">
      <section
        class="max-w-lg rounded-panel border border-app-border bg-white p-7"
      >
        <p class="goal-label">Configuration Required</p>
        <h1 class="mt-2 text-xl font-semibold">云端数据连接尚未配置</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-app-muted-foreground">
          生产环境已安全关闭数据访问。请在 Vercel Secure Environment Variables
          中配置 Supabase URL 与 Publishable Key，然后重新部署。
        </p>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
